HHIISSTTOORRYY
       ppnnmmssccaalleeffiixxeedd  was  originally  ppnnmmssccaallee. In Netpbm 9.9 (November 2000)
       ppnnmmssccaallee was rewritten to use floating  point  arithmetic;  the  former
       fixed point arithmetic version was renamed ppnnmmssccaalleeffiixxeedd.


